From 8c86e69fcf0f483360559e0bad20da8aa55f1816 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Hinder <ian.hinder@aei.mpg.de>
Date: Fri, 21 Oct 2011 09:50:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] optionlists: Add -rdynamic option to CFLAGS and CXXFLAGS for
 gcc and Intel compilers

This adds symbols needed in backtraces from Carpet
---
